        "Content": "Exceptional double-fronted five bedroom family home \r\n\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed rear extension maximising light and space\r\n\r\nPresented in superb turnkey condition\r\n\r\nGas fired central heating and mix of triple and double glazed windows \r\n\r\nConvenient side access to rear garden and garage\r\n\r\nOff-street parking for two cars behind electronic gates\r\n\r\nTotal floor area c. 192 sq.m."
